              "text": "When seeking the best AI tool to create shorts from long videos, several leading platforms offer robust features to automate and streamline the process. These tools leverage artificial intelligence to identify key moments, transcribe audio, generate captions, and reformat content for popular short-form video platforms like TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. The \"best\" tool often depends on specific user needs, such as desired level of automation, editing control, and budget.\n\nHere are some of the leading AI tools for transforming long videos into engaging shorts:\n\n*   **Opus Clip**\n    Opus Clip is highly regarded for its ability to convert long-form content into short, viral clips. It uses AI to identify the most valuable \"hooks\" in a video, rearrange content for context, and produce impactful clips. Key features include a \"virality score\" to help prioritize clips, automatic captions, and reformatting for vertical video platforms. Opus Clip also offers social media scheduling for platforms like TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube.\n    *   **Official Website:** opus.pro\n\n*   **Pictory AI**\n    Pictory AI excels at content repurposing, allowing users to transform text content (like scripts, blog posts, or existing videos) into editable short videos. It simplifies video creation and editing with features like AI avatars, voice cloning, and brand kits. Pictory can summarize long videos into short clips of chosen durations (e.g., 30 seconds to 5 minutes) with captions and branding.\n    *   **Official Website:** pictory.ai\n\n*   **CapCut AI**\n    CapCut, a widely used video editor, has significantly expanded its AI capabilities for long-video repurposing. It offers a suite of generative AI features,"
